#: illness_graphml.gpr.py:39
msgid ""
"Exports the people selected by the chosen export filter as a GraphML file, "
"ready to open and lay out in yEd: female persons get rounded-corner, "
"bordeaux-bordered boxes, male persons square-corner, navy-bordered ones, "
"each showing the person's name (bold), birth/death dates, cause of death, "
"and recorded illnesses. Families are drawn as a shared connecting point "
"between parents and children, and people are arranged generation by "
"generation as a starting layout to refine in yEd."
msgstr ""

